age\" title=\"Advantage\">Advantage</a> on Intimidation and Persuasion <a href=\"/wiki/Ability_Check\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Ability Check\">checks</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Resistance\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Resistance\">resistance</a> to <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/30px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/40px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Poison\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png/20px-Poison_Damage_Icon.png.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"20\" height=\"20\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/5/55/Poison_Damage_Icon.png\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span>⁠<a href=\"/wiki/Poison\" title=\"Poison\"><span class=\"bg3wiki-damage-type-poison\">Poison</span></a> damage, and can use <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Sickness\" title=\"Ray of Sickness\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp/38px-Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/7/74/Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp/50px-Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Ray of Sickness\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/7/74/Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp/25px-Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/7/74/Ray_of_Sickness_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Ray_of_Sickness\" title=\"Ray of Sickness\">Ray of Sickness</a